      "writtenOn": "2020-01-03T01:00:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "In many cases, direct dependencies only exist in the APEX, not in the system partition. Moving them back to system and place symlinks inside the APEX gives no benefit to us.",
      "parentUuid": "9f60f2ea_3578d39f",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 10,
        "startChar": 0,
